Da Vinci Laboratory SolutionsDa Vinci Laboratory Solutions 
Short company description 
Da Vinci Laboratory Solution BV is a growing and dynamic organization, specialized in delivering chromatographic solutions within the international laboratory industry. With a team of specialists we can support laboratories in optimizing their efficiency. See also our website: Welcome - Da Vinci Laboratory Solutions 
Who are we looking for? 
As an International Service Engineer you will be deployed to provide installations, application support and training to our customers worldwide. Our customers consist of end users and local distributors. You will travel independently to the customer or perform the work together with the local distributor. 
From our head office in Rotterdam, in addition to being internationally deployable, you will be involved in the construction and testing of our analyzers, and service work and customer support in the Netherlands are also part of the work. 
* Have a chemical/analytical background; 
* Have several years (4-6) of work experience with chromatography systems (GC, GC-MS and/or LC); 
* Have experience with petrochemical (ASTM) applications; 
* Willing to be deployed worldwide on a regular basis; 
* knowledge of computer hardware and IT management is an advantage; 
* Have an independent, accurate and customer-friendly attitude; 
* Speaks and writes excellent English; 
* To be eligible for this position, you must reside in the Netherlands 
What do we offer? 
Da Vinci Laboratory Solutions offers you a dynamic and independent position with a market-conform salary and good secondary employment conditions, such as a bonus scheme, 8,25% holiday allowance, lease car, a premium-free pension and extensive training opportunities. You work in a motivated team of committed colleagues. Da Vinci has a pleasant working atmosphere in which there is room for ideas and personal input and where mutual loyalty and joint efforts are cent...
